This repository contains unofficial Rust and C# ports of the SpacetimeDB TypeScript
submodules ("@spacetimedb/*" packages) developed by Clockwork Labs, Inc. in
https://github.com/clockworklabs/SpacetimeDB, which are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The original packages are Copyright Clockwork Labs, Inc.

Each ported file states the package and the commit it was ported from, and lists its changes
from the original. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Clockwork Labs.

The time-zone table embedded in cron/ is generated from the IANA Time Zone Database
(https://www.iana.org/time-zones), which is in the public domain.

The test vectors in tests/vectors/cron.json were generated with cron-parser 5.5.0
(https://github.com/harrisiirak/cron-parser, MIT License), the library @spacetimedb/cron uses.
